6. VOICE SEARCH — IMPORTANT ACCESSIBILITY FEATURE

Add a clearly visible microphone button inside the main job search bar.

This feature is essential because many workers cannot comfortably read or type.

How it should work

1. User opens the LOBORO app.
2. User sees the job search bar.
3. A large, easy-to-understand microphone icon appears inside or next to the search bar.
4. User taps the microphone.
5. App asks for microphone permission when required.
6. App listens to the user's spoken request.
7. Speech is converted into text.
8. The recognized text appears in the search bar.
9. User can edit the text or directly search.
10. Display matching jobs.

